WEBVTT

01:35.560 --> 01:38.280
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.360 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:50.400 --> 01:51.360
He's gone?

01:52.240 --> 01:53.080
He's really gone?

01:54.640 --> 01:55.880
Is he hiding?

01:56.920 --> 01:57.880
Stop looking.

01:57.960 --> 01:59.000
I've looked for him.

01:59.080 --> 02:00.080
He's really not here.

02:00.160 --> 02:01.480
He's really gone.

02:02.400 --> 02:04.280
I've been looking forward to it.

02:04.360 --> 02:05.720
He's really gone.

02:05.800 --> 02:06.680
That's great.

02:07.280 --> 02:08.400
- That's great.
- That's great.

02:08.479 --> 02:09.600
- He's gone.
- That's great.

02:10.240 --> 02:11.440
That's great!

02:12.480 --> 02:13.680
Thank goodness.

02:13.760 --> 02:15.280
He's an immortal criminal.

02:15.360 --> 02:16.360
Once someone finds out,

02:16.440 --> 02:19.080
you will definitely be charged
for hiding an escaped prisoner.

02:19.600 --> 02:21.040
Lord Arbiter is not here.

02:21.120 --> 02:22.320
Who will protect you then?

02:22.400 --> 02:23.640
Protect me?

02:24.320 --> 02:27.200
If my master finds out,
she won't forgive me.

02:28.520 --> 02:31.440
These days, I've been worried all day.

02:31.520 --> 02:32.720
He's finally gone.

02:34.960 --> 02:37.560
Even the air becomes more refreshing.

02:41.640 --> 02:45.000
Why should I care about
the likes and dislikes of a small plant?

02:48.960 --> 02:50.440
When I think about it,

02:50.520 --> 02:53.880
it was quite lively
during Daqiang's time here.

02:54.960 --> 02:56.680
Since my master left,

02:56.760 --> 02:59.960
no one has been with me all day
for a long time like this.

03:00.040 --> 03:02.120
I've only lived for 1,000 years.

03:02.920 --> 03:04.560
But he has been locked up in Haotian Tower

03:04.640 --> 03:05.840
for tens of thousands of years.

03:05.920 --> 03:07.720
He must be lonely.

03:07.800 --> 03:11.720
Haotian Tower is empty with nothing.

03:12.280 --> 03:14.320
There isn't even
a blade of grass in the tower.

03:17.880 --> 03:19.840
If he goes back this time,

03:19.920 --> 03:22.600
I wonder how much longer
he's going to jail alone.

03:24.560 --> 03:25.920
He's an immortal criminal.

03:26.000 --> 03:27.200
He deserves it.

03:27.280 --> 03:29.800
Orchid, stop thinking about it.

03:31.200 --> 03:33.680
But I think he's not that bad.

03:34.200 --> 03:35.720
We met and got to know each other.

03:35.800 --> 03:37.640
How could he…

03:37.720 --> 03:39.400
Even if we're not friends,

03:39.480 --> 03:41.400
he should at least say goodbye.

03:42.400 --> 03:43.920
He just left saying nothing.

03:48.400 --> 03:49.320
Forget it.

03:49.400 --> 03:51.000
It's a good thing after all.

03:52.120 --> 03:54.080
I'm just not used to it yet.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.720
Can you chat with me?

03:58.200 --> 03:59.920
No, Orchid.

04:00.000 --> 04:01.160
It's almost 1 p.m.

04:01.720 --> 04:04.400
We're going to sleep.

04:05.280 --> 04:06.280
No.

04:06.360 --> 04:07.960
Can you chat with me?

04:10.280 --> 04:12.360
I'm alone again.

04:40.760 --> 04:42.400
Daqiang, didn't you leave?

04:43.680 --> 04:44.680
Where have you been?

04:44.760 --> 04:46.280
I couldn't find you anywhere.

04:50.960 --> 04:53.480
This is morning dew.

04:55.920 --> 04:59.640
You disappeared for the whole morning
just to collect the morning dew?

04:59.720 --> 05:00.600
Yes.

05:01.440 --> 05:03.560
The morning dew is rootless water.

05:03.640 --> 05:05.720
It's good for your primordial spirit
of plant and wood.

05:05.800 --> 05:08.240
From now on, I'll collect it for you.

05:18.880 --> 05:21.560
Daqiang, let me ask you a question.

05:22.480 --> 05:24.920
Why are you so nice to me?

05:25.600 --> 05:27.360
Cut the crap. Drink it.

05:35.080 --> 05:38.640
The morning dew is too cold
with the chill of the night.

05:38.720 --> 05:39.920
I can't drink it.

05:40.720 --> 05:41.800
What do you want then?

05:41.880 --> 05:43.720
I'm not being picky.

05:43.800 --> 05:46.280
As you know, my immortal root is burned.

05:46.360 --> 05:47.880
So my body is afraid of cold.

05:47.960 --> 05:50.640
I used to drink heated water.

06:03.160 --> 06:04.120
Here.

06:10.880 --> 06:12.280
It's too hot.

06:12.360 --> 06:13.320
I can't drink it.

06:13.400 --> 06:14.720
I can't.

06:14.800 --> 06:17.240
It shouldn't be cold or hot.

06:17.880 --> 06:19.360
What do you want?

06:55.920 --> 06:57.120
It's not cold or hot now.

06:57.680 --> 06:58.640
You can drink it, right?

07:07.600 --> 07:08.440
Wait.

07:09.480 --> 07:11.800
You made efforts to collect this water.

07:12.400 --> 07:14.720
I can't just drink it directly.

07:15.280 --> 07:16.120
What?

07:17.160 --> 07:19.360
Do you want to make a fuss about it?

07:21.080 --> 07:23.520
The water looks tasteless.

07:23.600 --> 07:24.560
I'll get some honey.

07:24.640 --> 07:26.000
Add it to the water and drink it.

08:01.800 --> 08:02.840
Greetings, Lord Yunzhong.

08:06.640 --> 08:09.000
You have recently gone through
many battles in various places.

08:10.000 --> 08:12.280
Have you ever heard of
the whereabouts of the goddess?

08:12.880 --> 08:13.760
Lord Yunzhong,

08:14.400 --> 08:15.440
I haven't heard of her.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.120
It has been 30,000 years.

08:22.880 --> 08:24.360
I'm afraid the goddess has already…

08:26.800 --> 08:27.840
What?

08:29.640 --> 08:30.760
She has already died.

08:33.120 --> 08:35.960
The Xilan Tribe sealed
the Evil God Taisui for generations.

08:36.880 --> 08:38.400
If the goddess had really died,

08:39.080 --> 08:41.280
Taisui would've broken
through the restriction

08:41.360 --> 08:42.799
and caused chaos in the three realms.

08:42.880 --> 08:46.280
Taisui's story is just a legend.

08:46.360 --> 08:48.440
I'm afraid even you
have never seen Taisui.

08:48.520 --> 08:50.320
How can you be sure she is still alive?

08:50.400 --> 08:51.600
How dare you.

08:53.600 --> 08:55.640
The Xilan Tribe has guarded
Taisui for generations.

08:55.720 --> 08:57.040
They made great achievements.

08:57.120 --> 08:58.600
How dare you talk nonsense?

08:59.520 --> 09:01.400
I didn't mean to offend the goddess.

09:02.000 --> 09:05.120
I also hope I can find the goddess soon.

09:08.720 --> 09:10.200
After that,

09:10.800 --> 09:11.880
what will you do?

09:13.160 --> 09:14.960
Of course, I'll complete the engagement.

09:17.800 --> 09:19.160
Do you really think

09:20.080 --> 09:22.320
you've deceived the whole Shuiyuntian?

09:24.520 --> 09:26.000
Why do you say that?

09:34.600 --> 09:36.160
After you find the goddess,

09:36.240 --> 09:37.880
you want to break off the engagement

09:37.960 --> 09:40.160
and have an affair
with the owner of this handkerchief,

09:41.240 --> 09:42.360
right?

09:42.440 --> 09:43.320
Lord Yunzhong,

09:43.400 --> 09:45.240
I have nothing to do
with the owner of this handkerchief.

09:45.320 --> 09:46.240
Please investigate.

09:46.320 --> 09:47.800
Whether it's related or not,

09:47.880 --> 09:49.080
I'll find out about it.

09:49.160 --> 09:52.200
However, you ignored
your destiny to marry the goddess.

09:52.280 --> 09:53.960
It's a fact.

09:55.280 --> 09:56.200
Please calm down.

09:56.800 --> 09:59.240
In the future, I'll remember
the engagement with the goddess.

10:00.200 --> 10:01.560
I'll never be disloyal.

10:08.760 --> 10:10.520
Considering your military merits,

10:11.680 --> 10:13.240
I won't mention this matter.

10:33.040 --> 10:34.560
But you'd better remember

10:37.200 --> 10:38.680
to abide by destiny.

10:39.480 --> 10:40.920
Don't make any mistakes.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.720
This is your duty.

11:18.640 --> 11:21.440
I added six kinds of herbs
and seven kinds of honey.

11:21.520 --> 11:22.400
It's delicious.

11:22.480 --> 11:24.000
Daqiang, do you want to try it?

11:27.200 --> 11:28.280
I know.

11:28.360 --> 11:29.320
I'll drink it myself.

11:29.400 --> 11:30.760
Don't stare at me like that.

11:36.120 --> 11:37.280
It's delicious.

11:44.920 --> 11:46.680
Daqiang, is it enough?

11:46.760 --> 11:49.240
No, finish it.

12:12.680 --> 12:13.520
My lord.

12:14.800 --> 12:16.960
You stay here and protect her.

12:17.040 --> 12:18.800
Don't make any mistakes.

12:18.880 --> 12:20.040
I'll be back soon.

12:20.600 --> 12:21.440
Yes.

12:40.760 --> 12:45.760
FIVE HUNDRED YEARS AGO

12:47.040 --> 12:49.120
Did you always get bullied?

12:52.080 --> 12:54.160
Don't be afraid.
I'll protect you from now on.

12:54.880 --> 12:55.760
Protect me?

12:58.640 --> 13:00.560
Although my power is weak,

13:00.640 --> 13:02.600
I'm good at running away.

13:02.680 --> 13:04.400
If you're in danger,

13:04.480 --> 13:06.120
I'll take you far away from here.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.520
I used to protect others.

13:09.080 --> 13:10.040
No one…

13:11.400 --> 13:12.880
No one said he would protect me.

13:14.320 --> 13:15.680
I don't need protection either.

13:16.920 --> 13:17.840
No.

13:17.920 --> 13:20.120
Everyone needs protection,
no matter who he is.

13:21.400 --> 13:24.520
My brother taught me
not to show my weakness to others.

13:27.720 --> 13:29.680
It's okay that no one
has protected you before.

13:30.200 --> 13:31.360
I'll be the first one.

13:38.640 --> 13:41.360
Do you think I'm too weak?

14:23.600 --> 14:24.520
My lord.

14:26.280 --> 14:27.200
What's the matter?

14:27.280 --> 14:30.040
Fairy Danyin asked me
to give this box of pastries to you.

14:30.560 --> 14:31.840
She said she made it herself.

14:31.920 --> 14:34.920
Didn't I tell you
not to accept gifts from them?

14:35.000 --> 14:36.160
Yes.

14:36.240 --> 14:37.440
But Fairy Danyin insisted

14:37.520 --> 14:39.600
- that I must take this box of cake--
- Whose subordinate are you?

14:40.280 --> 14:41.480
Who do you work for?

14:43.240 --> 14:44.360
I know I was wrong.

14:45.320 --> 14:46.360
Send it back tomorrow.

14:47.120 --> 14:49.960
Also, tell her that
she doesn't need to send gifts anymore.

14:50.960 --> 14:51.880
Yes.

14:55.400 --> 14:56.240
Wait.

15:08.120 --> 15:09.400
Take this away.

15:12.080 --> 15:12.960
It's useless now.

15:24.640 --> 15:26.080
Why are you back so late?

15:26.160 --> 15:28.280
I left your dinner in the kitchen.

15:28.360 --> 15:30.120
Go get it yourself. I'm going to bed.

15:37.640 --> 15:38.480
What are you doing?

15:41.640 --> 15:43.240
Your room is really cold.

15:43.320 --> 15:45.200
It's colder at night.

15:50.560 --> 15:51.720
What is this?

15:52.480 --> 15:54.000
The kindling of Eternal Fire.

15:54.080 --> 15:55.360
Eternal Fire?

15:56.240 --> 15:58.440
Could it be the one written in the book?

15:58.520 --> 16:01.480
It's said that it has been burning
since ancient times and will never go out.

16:01.560 --> 16:02.680
That's right.

16:04.680 --> 16:05.680
In the legendary,

16:05.760 --> 16:08.280
Eternal Fire is from
the magma of Cangyan Sea.

16:08.360 --> 16:09.760
Where did you get it?

16:29.080 --> 16:30.360
It's so warm.

16:31.320 --> 16:34.120
Your true form is the orchid,
which likes warmth and hates cold.

16:34.680 --> 16:36.400
A warm room is good for you.

16:40.320 --> 16:41.200
Did you

16:42.920 --> 16:46.480
go to the magma of Cangyan sea
because of me?

16:46.960 --> 16:49.000
Why are you so reckless?

16:49.080 --> 16:50.640
It's okay for me to feel cold.

16:50.720 --> 16:52.120
Do you know how dangerous it is?

16:52.200 --> 16:53.840
Even the Moon Tribe dare not approach it.

16:53.920 --> 16:56.360
You're just an immortal criminal.
What if you lose your life?

16:56.440 --> 16:57.880
Cut the crap.

16:57.960 --> 17:00.960
It's just a piece of cake for me.

17:03.000 --> 17:06.280
He loves me so much.

17:08.040 --> 17:09.839
Why are you staring at me?

17:13.160 --> 17:14.160
Daqiang.

17:15.400 --> 17:17.280
I like other people.

17:17.359 --> 17:19.599
- I told you, right?
- Didn't I tell you?

17:19.680 --> 17:22.400
You can like anyone, but you belong to me.

17:27.319 --> 17:28.200
No.

17:28.280 --> 17:30.800
Orchid, you can't be bewitched
by his sweet words.

17:32.880 --> 17:35.600
Daqiang, you're so nice to me.

17:35.680 --> 17:37.760
Why don't you…

17:39.160 --> 17:40.040
You should…

17:40.120 --> 17:41.360
Just say it.

17:42.720 --> 17:44.720
You should confess your crime
as early as possible.

17:44.800 --> 17:47.240
Then get out of prison as soon as possible
and live a new life.

17:53.800 --> 17:56.520
I'm really bad at talking.

18:00.400 --> 18:01.960
"The Xilan Holy Plant

18:03.080 --> 18:05.120
is born in the south of Xishan.

18:05.200 --> 18:07.000
It's beautiful with the sunshine,

18:08.000 --> 18:11.160
especially the sunshine
from the rising sun."

18:18.160 --> 18:19.400
The rising sun?

18:20.320 --> 18:22.240
Does it mean
the first sunshine in the morning?

18:23.680 --> 18:24.920
I guess so.

18:26.720 --> 18:28.400
I never thought

18:29.400 --> 18:30.520
raising a plant

18:31.160 --> 18:32.920
was so troublesome.

18:34.800 --> 18:35.640
My lord,

18:36.280 --> 18:37.400
please wait a little longer.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.480
When she fixes the Destiny Book,

18:40.120 --> 18:41.160
we will succeed.

18:45.640 --> 18:49.000
I can do everything in this world.

18:49.080 --> 18:51.120
As for raising a plant,

18:51.200 --> 18:53.000
how can it be difficult for me?

18:53.920 --> 18:55.000
You're great, my lord.

19:03.040 --> 19:05.480
The Arbiter Hall faces north.

19:06.040 --> 19:07.560
It's remote and dark.

19:07.640 --> 19:08.960
There's not enough morning light.

19:12.040 --> 19:13.720
I see.

19:14.360 --> 19:17.640
No wonder that Little Flower Spirit
is so weak and useless.

19:18.200 --> 19:20.880
Other plants can hardly become human.

19:23.640 --> 19:27.520
Then I'll take her to the best place
with abundant sunshine in Shuiyuntian

19:27.600 --> 19:29.080
to enjoy the sunshine.

19:54.120 --> 19:55.240
Get up and come with me.

19:57.520 --> 19:58.760
Daqiang, are you crazy?

19:58.840 --> 20:00.080
It's not dawn yet.

20:00.160 --> 20:01.400
Where are you taking me?

20:01.480 --> 20:02.760
You'll know when you get there.

20:35.080 --> 20:37.560
How long will you hold me?

20:45.760 --> 20:48.640
Where is this place?

20:49.200 --> 20:50.960
I've never been here.

20:54.600 --> 20:56.440
You took me to fly for so long.

20:56.520 --> 20:58.400
This place must be very high.

20:58.960 --> 21:02.040
The highest place in Shuiyuntian is…

21:04.480 --> 21:06.120
Yunzhong Water Pavilion.

21:10.240 --> 21:12.400
Daqiang, you want to kill me?

21:12.480 --> 21:14.760
Yunzhong Water Pavilion
is the hall of Lord Yunzhong.

21:14.840 --> 21:15.720
Not only you and me,

21:15.800 --> 21:18.080
but even the senior gods
also can't come without summoning.

21:18.160 --> 21:19.240
If we get caught, we'll die.

21:19.320 --> 21:20.400
Let's go.

21:21.480 --> 21:22.600
Hurry up.

21:24.800 --> 21:26.320
If you don't leave, I'll leave.

21:33.880 --> 21:36.080
I'm doomed.

21:36.160 --> 21:37.360
I'm doomed.

21:37.440 --> 21:39.120
We seem to have been discovered.

21:41.800 --> 21:45.120
Dear heavenly soldiers, please arrest me.

21:45.200 --> 21:47.160
I know I'm sinful.

21:47.240 --> 21:49.560
But we really didn't mean it.

21:49.640 --> 21:50.880
Please.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.120
Daqiang, what are you doing?

21:53.200 --> 21:54.320
Kneel together.

21:55.520 --> 21:56.480
Dear heavenly soldiers,

21:56.560 --> 21:59.000
you can catch and lock me in Haotian Tower

21:59.080 --> 22:00.360
for 300 to 500 years.

22:00.440 --> 22:02.520
I really don't want
to be banished to Shenshui Hall.

22:02.600 --> 22:04.200
It's not easy for us to…

22:06.960 --> 22:07.960
They…

22:08.040 --> 22:09.240
Why are they…

22:10.040 --> 22:10.880
They…

22:13.680 --> 22:14.960
Why are they ignoring us?

22:17.280 --> 22:18.200
Hello?

22:19.000 --> 22:19.840
Hello?

22:22.920 --> 22:24.520
They can't hear us.

22:27.480 --> 22:28.600
Are we…

22:38.760 --> 22:40.040
We're invisible.

22:43.080 --> 22:44.280
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

22:44.360 --> 22:46.560
I almost thought
I'd be banished to Shenshui Hall.

22:46.640 --> 22:47.640
You scared me.

22:48.680 --> 22:49.520
Follow me.

23:02.200 --> 23:04.720
It turns out that looking from
the high place of Shuiyuntian,

23:04.800 --> 23:06.480
the scenery is so beautiful.

23:12.120 --> 23:12.960
My goodness.

23:13.040 --> 23:14.160
I've been here for so long,

23:14.240 --> 23:15.880
but I've never seen
such beautiful scenery.

23:19.000 --> 23:19.920
No.

23:22.320 --> 23:23.680
Let's go quickly.

23:23.760 --> 23:25.560
Even if we can hide with invisible magic
to avoid heavenly soldiers,

23:25.640 --> 23:26.640
when the high immortals come,

23:26.720 --> 23:28.200
we'll still be discovered.

23:28.280 --> 23:30.080
- Hurry up.
- As long as I want,

23:30.160 --> 23:32.560
no high immortal will find us.

23:34.560 --> 23:36.160
You're bragging.

23:36.240 --> 23:37.320
Are you really so powerful?

23:37.400 --> 23:39.200
Why are you still so unknown?

23:39.280 --> 23:42.760
Why haven't I heard of Dongfang Qiang?

23:43.640 --> 23:44.480
It's coming.

23:45.880 --> 23:46.720
Coming?

23:46.800 --> 23:48.040
What is coming?

23:48.120 --> 23:49.360
The heavenly soldiers

23:49.920 --> 23:51.360
or high immortals?

24:06.080 --> 24:07.160
Sunrise.

24:13.600 --> 24:15.160
You did this

24:16.800 --> 24:18.600
just to take me to see the sunrise?

24:18.680 --> 24:19.880
You're so lazy.

24:19.960 --> 24:21.960
You get up at noon every day.

24:22.040 --> 24:23.880
Have you ever seen the rising sun before?

24:27.880 --> 24:29.480
No wonder your power is so weak

24:29.560 --> 24:31.360
after your transformation
a thousand years ago.

24:33.720 --> 24:35.000
I told you

24:35.080 --> 24:37.760
my power is weak
because my immortal root is damaged.

24:38.520 --> 24:39.440
Besides,

24:39.520 --> 24:41.160
the rising sun is the same as the sunset.

24:41.240 --> 24:43.800
They are all red and round.

24:44.360 --> 24:46.560
I've seen the sunset.
It means I've seen the rising sun.

24:46.640 --> 24:47.920
Nonsense.

24:49.080 --> 24:50.360
Focus on your sunbathing.

25:06.400 --> 25:07.520
It's so beautiful.

25:12.440 --> 25:13.920
Are you so happy?

25:14.000 --> 25:15.240
Of course.

25:15.320 --> 25:16.280
It's so beautiful.

25:16.960 --> 25:19.880
I can never be here with my identity.

25:22.840 --> 25:24.720
The fairy realm is so hypocritical.

25:24.800 --> 25:26.280
You can't teach an old dog new tricks.

25:26.840 --> 25:28.480
They talk about benevolence and morality.

25:28.560 --> 25:30.240
In fact, they are greedy and domineering.

25:30.800 --> 25:32.560
They occupy the best place,

25:32.640 --> 25:36.160
but they determine the class of others
just because of their backgrounds.

25:36.240 --> 25:37.160
Daqiang.

25:41.800 --> 25:42.920
Thank you.

26:01.920 --> 26:03.600
Cloud…

26:03.680 --> 26:05.560
Look, it's Cloud-Whale.

27:22.000 --> 27:23.520
These days,

27:24.400 --> 27:26.920
I've been nurturing her
according to the details in the book.

27:27.680 --> 27:29.160
I never make her tired.

27:29.240 --> 27:31.880
I worked hard
to collect morning dew for her

27:31.960 --> 27:33.240
and take her to bask in the sun.

27:34.680 --> 27:37.600
But why hasn't her power improved?

27:47.200 --> 27:48.760
Why is this happening?

28:32.680 --> 28:33.880
It hurts badly.

28:37.160 --> 28:39.160
I nursed her according to the book.

28:39.240 --> 28:40.680
- Help me.
- Why is she getting worse?

28:40.760 --> 28:42.200
I'm dying.

28:43.080 --> 28:44.120
What did you eat today?

28:48.600 --> 28:50.000
You stole it from my room.

28:50.080 --> 28:52.160
I hid it for your own good.

28:52.240 --> 28:54.040
Your true form is wood
and it's afraid of fire.

28:54.120 --> 28:55.560
How dare you take
the medicine of extreme yang?

28:55.640 --> 28:57.120
Aren't you afraid that
you'll burn yourself to ashes?

29:04.720 --> 29:08.400
Daqiang, I think I'm dying.

29:09.800 --> 29:11.800
Am I going to die?

29:16.280 --> 29:17.120
Yes.

29:21.200 --> 29:23.200
I don't want to die yet.

29:25.880 --> 29:27.320
Daqiang.

29:27.400 --> 29:31.720
I find that although you
have a bad temper and are sharp-tongued,

29:31.800 --> 29:33.720
you're not bad in nature.

29:34.760 --> 29:35.760
In the three realms,

29:35.840 --> 29:37.800
nobody is worse than me.

29:38.440 --> 29:40.840
You even strive to be the top in that.

29:40.920 --> 29:42.400
I'm the worst one.

29:42.480 --> 29:43.520
No need to strive for it.

29:44.680 --> 29:45.800
Daqiang.

29:46.280 --> 29:47.680
After I die,

29:47.760 --> 29:50.320
you should confess your crime
as early as possible.

29:50.400 --> 29:53.360
Losing your freedom
is better than losing your life.

29:54.320 --> 29:56.880
There are some spirit stones in my drawer.

29:56.960 --> 29:58.560
After I die,

29:58.640 --> 30:00.160
you can take them away

30:00.240 --> 30:02.520
and buy something you like
to take back to Haotian Tower--

30:02.600 --> 30:05.000
You won't die if I'm here.

30:08.000 --> 30:10.080
Don't comfort me.

30:11.680 --> 30:14.480
Even if you die,
it's because of your own stupidity.

30:14.560 --> 30:17.120
I've expelled
all the yang energy from your body.

30:21.320 --> 30:23.560
It doesn't hurt anymore.

30:38.720 --> 30:39.600
What's wrong?

30:39.680 --> 30:40.800
Are you still feeling uncomfortable?

30:44.280 --> 30:45.560
I'm much better.

30:46.680 --> 30:47.760
Then why do you want to cry?

30:48.920 --> 30:50.960
When I was sick,

30:51.600 --> 30:54.760
my master would cook
flower soup to let me drink.

30:55.400 --> 30:57.360
I miss my master.

30:58.640 --> 30:59.640
Stop thinking about it.

31:00.400 --> 31:02.400
If you feel sad, I feel sad too.

31:10.160 --> 31:11.080
Rest early.

31:37.760 --> 31:40.080
How long will she be sad?

32:00.000 --> 32:00.880
Master.

32:01.920 --> 32:02.880
Master.

32:13.200 --> 32:14.320
Here, my good disciple.

32:15.040 --> 32:15.880
Open your mouth.

32:38.400 --> 32:39.680
If the curse doesn't break,

32:39.760 --> 32:42.960
I have to have the same feeling as her.

33:09.800 --> 33:10.880
Daqiang.

33:10.960 --> 33:12.520
Daqiang, what are you doing?

33:12.600 --> 33:14.320
What are you doing?

33:14.400 --> 33:16.120
Are you going to
burn down the Arbiter Hall?

33:16.200 --> 33:17.480
What are you doing?

33:17.560 --> 33:19.880
Why did you cook on the rooftop?

33:29.920 --> 33:30.840
Drink.

33:32.680 --> 33:35.400
Is this medicine you made for me?

33:35.480 --> 33:37.280
This is the flower soup I cooked for you.

33:40.160 --> 33:41.160
Flower soup.

33:42.080 --> 33:42.960
Drink it.

33:43.040 --> 33:45.040
Don't be sad
and miss your master after drinking it.

33:52.120 --> 33:53.240
Did you cook it

33:53.800 --> 33:56.760
to make me happy?

34:04.800 --> 34:06.160
Don't cry.

34:31.800 --> 34:34.560
Daqiang, thank you.

34:36.239 --> 34:37.159
You…

34:38.000 --> 34:38.960
You're not sad anymore?

34:41.360 --> 34:42.679
Then why are you crying?

34:44.719 --> 34:47.920
People don't only cry when they are sad.

34:48.000 --> 34:52.239
People also cry
when they are happy or excited.

34:52.320 --> 34:54.639
There are many kinds of human feelings.

34:54.719 --> 34:56.760
Tears are different too.

34:57.560 --> 35:00.200
Have you stayed
in Haotian Tower for too long

35:00.280 --> 35:01.760
that you don't even know that?

35:03.720 --> 35:05.520
Having emotional roots
is really troublesome.

35:06.880 --> 35:07.800
You…

35:10.120 --> 35:11.080
Cry less.

35:15.840 --> 35:16.920
Drink it.

35:40.640 --> 35:41.840
Is it good?

35:44.520 --> 35:45.480
Yes.

35:46.760 --> 35:47.720
Here's more.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.320
I…

35:54.400 --> 35:55.760
I'm full.

35:56.400 --> 35:57.800
I'm so sleepy.

35:57.880 --> 35:59.320
I'm going to bed.

35:59.400 --> 36:00.280
Good night.

36:11.400 --> 36:13.640
She finished it in one sip.

36:15.000 --> 36:19.720
I'm good at practicing magic.

36:20.760 --> 36:24.560
Do I also have the talent for cooking?

37:09.960 --> 37:13.720
This garden is connected
with her primordial spirit.

37:16.040 --> 37:18.040
The secret of nursing her

37:18.120 --> 37:20.200
is not taking care of her body

37:20.800 --> 37:22.400
but her heart instead?

37:26.560 --> 37:29.240
How can I make her happy?
